      "message": "fix(machines): Tormach lathes state spindle.rigid_tapping from the manuals\n\nThe 8L, 15L Slant-PRO and 15LX Slant-PRO files now state\n\"rigid_tapping\": true. Each operator manual (UM10753 10.3.18, UM10225\n6.5.17, UM10860 10.3.13) has a G33.1 rigid-tapping section. The pin\nevery_tormach_mill_router_and_lathe_file_states_rigid_tapping now\nchecks the three lathes. Posted output does not change: the gate\nrefuses only a stated false, and tormach-lathe.cps still refuses TAP.\n\nFixes #795\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>",
